OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 21, who died after city
OL,4,Acentre attack named by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man who died after being
OL,7,Fattacked in Glasgow city centre has
OL,8,Fbeen named by police.
OL,10,FDaniel Colrain was found with serious
OL,11,Finjuries in Royal Exchange Square at
OL,12,Fabout 03:05 on Sunday. He died in
OL,13,Fhospital the following day.
OL,15,FA 19-year-old man has been arrested in
OL,16,Fconnection with the disturbance and
OL,17,Freleased pending further inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
