OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 21, who died after city
OL,4,Acentre attack named by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother man, aged 21, was also
OL,7,Fassaulted and suffered minor injuries.
OL,8,FA 20-year-old man has been charged in
OL,9,Fconnection with this and is due to
OL,10,Fappear before Glasgow Sheriff Court at
OL,11,Fa later date.
